1H), 7.68 (t, J = 7.6 Hz, 1H), 7.65-7.53 (m, 3H), 7.11 (dd, J = 8.0, 0.8
Hz, 1H), 7.01-6.95 (m, 2H), 6.90 (t, J = 7.8 Hz, 1H), 6.08 (s, 2H), 4.12
(brs, 2H), 3.72 (brs, 2H), 3.11 (brs, 2H), 2.17-2.06 (m, 2H). MW+2HCl:
534.48.
