Chen, Guang-Pei; Calienni, John; Villhauer, Edwin; Prasad, Kapa; Repic,
Oljan; Blacklock, Thomas J.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Organic Process Research & Development (2007), 11(5), 825-835

