$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: Preparation of
6-(2'-((dimethylamino)methyl)biphenyl-4-yl)-1-(4-methoxyphenyl)-7-oxo-4,5,6,7-tetrahydro-1H-pyrazolo[3,4-c]pyridine-3-carboxamide
(13c). Preparation of
6-(2'-((diethylamino)methyl)biphenyl-4-yl)-1-(4-methoxyphenyl)-7-oxo-4,5,6,7-tetrahydro-1H-pyrazolo[3,4-c]pyridine-3-carboxamide
(13d). The title compound 13d was prepared from compound 10b by reductive
amination with diethylamine, following procedure previously described for
13c in 60% yield. HPLC purity > 95%. 1HNMR (DMSO-d6) δ : 9.12 (m,1H),
7.77 (s, 1H), 7.74 (dd, J =3.30, 5.90 Hz, 1H), 7.56 (m, 4H), 7.52 (d, J
=8.50Hz, 2H), 7.42 (d, J =8.40Hz, 2H), 7.37 (m, 1H), 7.03 (d, J =9.10Hz,
2H), 4.32 (d, J =5.10Hz, 2H), 4.14 (t, J =6.30 Hz, 2H), 3.81 (s, 3H),
3.26 (t, J =6.60 Hz, 2H), 3.03 (m, 2H), 2.87 (m, 2H), 0.95 (t, J =7.30
Hz, 6H) ppm. ESIMS m/z 519.2 (M+H).+ HRMS calculated for C31H34N5O3
(M+H)+ 524.2662; found 524.2662. Anal. Calcd. For
C31H33N5O3.1.0TFA.1.2H2O: C, 59.13, H, 5.38, N, 10.32; found C, 59.15, H,
5.16, N, 10.12.
