solvent and excess of HCl were evaporated in vacuo to give the
corresponding HCl salt. Structure1. Structure3. Yield 55.4%. 1H NMR
(DMSO-d6): 14.04 (brs, 1H), 9.57 (brs, 1H), 9.35 (brs, 2H), 8.70 (d, J =
