1H), 6.97 (dd, J = 8.0, 1.2 Hz, 1H), 6.93 (d, J = 7.2 Hz, 1H), 6.90 (t, J
= 8.0 Hz, 1H), 6.07 (s, 2H), 4.11 (s, 2H), 3.68 (brs, 2H), 3.09 (brs,
