$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Preparation of
(R)-6-(2'-((3-hydroxypyrrolidin-1-yl)methyl)biphenyl-4-yl)-1-(4-methoxyphenyl)-3-(trifluoromethyl)-5,6-dihydro-1H-pyrazolo[3,4-c]pyridin-7(4H)-one
(6). To
4'-(1-(4-methoxyphenyl)-7-oxo-3-(trifluoromethyl)-4,5-dihydro-1H-pyrazolo[3,4-c]pyridin-6(7H)-yl)biphenyl-2-carboxaldehyde
( 76 mg,0.15 mmol) in MeOH (4 ml) was added 3-(R)-pyrrolidinol (40 mg,
0.45 mmol) and stirred 15 min. A solution of 0.5 M ZnCl2 in THF (0.15 mL)
and sodium cyanoborohydride (10 mg, 0.15 mmol) were added and the
reaction was stirred 24 h. The reaction was stripped and the residue was
partitioned in EtOAc and water. The water layer was extracted with EtOAc.
The combined organic layers were washed with water, brine and dried (
MgSO4). Purification by reverse phase HPLC and freeze-drying afforded
compound 6 (49 mg, 50%) of a white solid. 1H NMR (MeOD) δ : 7.66 (m, 1H),
7.54 (t, J = 4.04 Hz, 2H), 7.51-7.47 (m, 4H), 7.41 (m, 3H), 7.02 (d, J =
9.0 Hz, 2 H), 4.56 (m, 1 H), 4.42 (m, 2 H), 4.23 (t, J = 6.60 Hz, 2H),
3.84 (s, 3H), 3.56-3.35 (m, 2H), 3.21 (t, J = 6.60 Hz, 2H), 3.12-2.87 (m,
2H), 2.17- 1.86 (m, 2H) ppm; HRMS calculated for C31H30F3N4O3 (M+H)+
563.2270; found 563.2260. Anal. Calcd. For C31H29F3N4O5.1.3TFA.0.1H2O: C,
56.63, H, 4.31, N, 7.86; found C, 56.26, H, 4.41, N, 7.99.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Discovery of
1-(4-Methoxyphenyl)-7-oxo-6-[4-(2-oxo-1-piperidinyl]phenyl)-4,5,6,7-tetrahydro-1H-pyrazolo[3,4-c]pyridine-3-carboxamide
(Apixaban, BMS-562247), a Highly Potent, Selective, Efficacious, and
Orally Bioavailable Inhibitor of Blood Coagulation Factor Xa
