$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Preparation of
(R)-3-((1H-Tetrazol-1-yl)methyl)-6-(2’-((3-hydroxypyrrolidin-1-yl)methyl)biphenyl-4-yl)-1-(4-methoxyphenyl)-5,6-dihydro-1H-pyrazolo[3,4-c]pyridin-7(4H)-one
(33d) and
(R)-3-((2H-Tetrazol-2-yl)methyl)-6-(2'-((3-hydroxypyrrolidin-1-yl)methyl)biphenyl-4-yl)-1-(4-methoxyphenyl)-5,6-dihydro-1H-pyrazolo[3,4-c]pyridin-7(4H)-one
(33e). The title compounds 33d and 33e were also prepared according to
the procedure outlined for compounds 33a and 33b, via the displacement of
the bromide 30 (1.0 g, 1.8 mmol) with 1H-tetrazole (0.16 g, 4.4 mmol) and
NaH (60%, 0.176 g, 4.30 mmol) in DMF (15 mL). Purification by silica gel
column chromatography (1:3 hexanes/EtOAc as eluent) afforded the
1-tetrazole intermediate 31d (44 mg) and the 2-tetrazole intermediate 31e
(25 mg) for a combined yield of 70%. The tetrazole derivatives 31d,e were
converted to the desired products 33d and 33e according to the procedures
previously described for compounds 33a,b. Purification by reverse-phase
HPLC (acetonitrile/water/0.05% TFA) and lyophilization gave the desired
product 33d as a colorless solid (85 mg, 18% over two steps). Compound
33e was similarly obtained as a colorless solid after lyophilization (145
mg, 63% over two steps). 33d: HPLC purity, >95%. 1H NMR (DMSO-d6) δ :
9.58 (s, 1H), 7.76 (m, 1H), 7.53 (m, 4H), 7.45 (d, J = 8.40 Hz, 2H), 7.38
(d, J = 8.50 Hz, 2H), 7.33 (m, 1H), 6.99 (d, J = 8.70 Hz, 2H), 5.88 (s,
2H), 4.49 (d, J = 5.50 Hz, 1H), 4.38 (m, 1H), 4.30 (m, 1H), 4.12 (t, J =
6.60 Hz, 2H), 3.79 (s, 3H), 3.55 (m, 2H), 3.10-2.85 (m, 2H), 2.96 (t, J =
6.60 Hz, 2H), 2.10-1.74 (m, 3H) ppm. ESIMS m/z 577.12 (M + H)+. HRMS
calculated C32H33N8O3 (M + H)+ 577.2588; found 577.2698. 33e: HPLC
purity, >95%. 1H NMR (DMSO-d6) δ : 9.04 (s, 1H), 7.75 (m, 1H), 7.53 (m,
6H), 7.38 (d, J = 8.00 Hz, 2H), 7.33 (m, 1H), 6.99 (d, J = 9.20 Hz, 2H),
6.12 (s, 2H), 4.49 (d, J = 5.50 Hz, 1H), 4.38 (m, 1H), 4.30 (m, 1H), 4.12
(t, J = 6.60 Hz, 2H), 3.79 (s, 3H), 3.55 (m, 2H), 3.10-2.85 (m, 2H), 2.96
(t, J = 6.60 Hz, 2H), 2.10-1.74 (m, 3H) ppm. ESIMS m/z 577.12 (M + H)+.
HRMS calculated for C32H33N8O3 (M + H)+ 577.2676; found 577.2686. Anal.
Calcd for C32H32N8O3·1.0TFA·1.1H2O: C, 57.04, H, 4.91, N, 15.56. Found:
C, 57.00, H, 4.82, N, 15.58.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Discovery of
1-(4-Methoxyphenyl)-7-oxo-6-[4-(2-oxo-1-piperidinyl]phenyl)-4,5,6,7-tetrahydro-1H-pyrazolo[3,4-c]pyridine-3-carboxamide
(Apixaban, BMS-562247), a Highly Potent, Selective, Efficacious, and
Orally Bioavailable Inhibitor of Blood Coagulation Factor Xa
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Pinto, Donald J. P.; Orwat, Michael J.; Koch, Stephanie; Rossi, Karen A.;
Alexander, Richard S.; Smallwood, Angela; Wong, Pancras C.; Rendina, Alan
R.; Luettgen, Joseph M.; Knabb, Robert M.; He, Kan; Xin, Baomin; Wexler,
Ruth R.; Lam, Patrick Y. S.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Journal of Medicinal Chemistry (2007), 50(22), 5339-5356

